(Problem: Write an ANSI C program to convert temperature from Fahrenheit to Celsius using) Tj
T*
(formula C = \(5.0/9.0\) * \(F - 32\). Demonstrate integer vs. floating-point division) Tj
T*
(pitfalls and format specifiers.) Tj
T*
(Source Code:) Tj
T*
(#include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
(int main\(\) {) Tj
T*
(double fahrenheit, celsius;) Tj
