T*
(}) Tj
T*
(/* Note: Writing 5/9 causes integer division truncation to 0. Must use 5.0/9.0 */) Tj
T*
(celsius = \(5.0 / 9.0\) * \(fahrenheit - 32.0\);) Tj
T*
