/F1 9 Tf
(Problem: Write a program to verify short-circuit evaluation of logical operators && and) Tj
T*
(|| in C expressions containing embedded side-effect increments.) Tj
T*
(Source Code:) Tj
T*
(#include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
(int main\(\) {) Tj
T*
(int a = 0, b = 5, c = 10;) Tj
T*
(int res1 = \(a && \(++b\)\);) Tj
T*
(printf\("res1: %d | a: %d | b: %d \(b was NOT incremented\)\\n", res1, a, b\);) Tj
T*
(int res2 = \(b || \(++c\)\);) Tj
T*
(printf\("res2: %d | b: %d | c: %d \(c was NOT incremented\)\\n", res2, b, c\);) Tj
T*
(int res3 = \(a || \(++b\)\);) Tj
T*
(printf\("res3: %d | a: %d | b: %d \(b WAS incremented to 6\)\\n", res3, a, b\);) Tj
T*
